              <img width="48" data-src="https://cdn.myanimelist.net/r/48x71/images/anime/12/85221.jpg?s=85fa7ab64a20802ed90e12813fca77ba" data-srcset="https://cdn.myanimelist.net/r/48x71/images/anime/12/85221.jpg?s=85fa7ab64a20802ed90e12813fca77ba 1x, https://cdn.myanimelist.net/r/96x142/images/anime/12/85221.jpg?s=1047c47b5d24f58f7c2895d13458c077 2x" class="lazyload" />
