                TLDR Start really good and the first few episodes are really enjoyable, but then it just becomes a mess. As soon as the first story part is over nothing feels enyoable anymore. Logic errors, things get never explained, behaviour of every character makes no sense. The worldbuilding we had before gets just ignored and gaps remain unsolved or plainly contradicted.<br />
