<br />
We start strong. I liked the first episodes even if they were not oustanding they were enjoyable. The rebirth happens and its still ok. It even feels somewhat realistic and not typical anime cliches
                  <span class="js-visible" style="margin-left: -4px;">...</span>
          <span class="js-hidden" style="display: none;">are done. But then the Story quickly goes downhill. In a world where magic declined so much mc shoudl easily be the strongest but he wants to hide it. Ok acceptable. But then when charactes from the past join its gets bad. really bad. Story gaps happen. We already had soem early on but more and more things gets thrown into story without ever beeing explained. The overaching Story of why magic declined even for people that were around 400 years back is just plain ignored. We have side storys and side cahrachters getting more secreentime and ever detail we learn just adds to the logical errors and story gaps. In the end i just could not enjoy it anymore. i wanted to skip so bad but struggled to watch through it. but around episode 8 or 9 i just lost all interest. After the first half of teh series it declines to hard and becomes typical animal slop with dozen of gaps or logic errors and all enjoyment was lost.</span>
