                Slice of Lowlife? Literal Gag Anime? Well, I personally didn&#039;t find it too gross but it comes down to your tolerances. If you are unaware, it has a lot of dirty humor that may or may not be a deal breaker for certain people. That said, the show has very high production value for what it is and it clearly comes from someone passionate.<br />
